            {
                "entry_id": "b3be31dd-1965-3d91-9b9d-07f0ed4513b8",
                "word": "Pravda",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f00a304b-a80c-4dc5-8dba-332b01f8b9d2",
                        "entry_id": "b3be31dd-1965-3d91-9b9d-07f0ed4513b8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Pravdas"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "46df4e73-e00a-370c-bb3f-b6940840963b",
                        "entry_id": "b3be31dd-1965-3d91-9b9d-07f0ed4513b8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A newspaper or other media channel seen as untrustworthy and biased towards its owners or the establishment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "61423324-dd0e-48c4-a36b-9076f07038ee",
                                "sense_id": "46df4e73-e00a-370c-bb3f-b6940840963b",
                                "text": "The fundamental purpose of the Government in introducing this measure, and in turning their three kept newspapers — the three Pravdas of Fianna Fail — to the propaganda campaign, is to wipe out the Labour Party, Clann na Talmhan, Clann na Poblachta and the Independents."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f4e982e-ac08-4d0f-89b0-4670b82d5d1e",
                                "sense_id": "46df4e73-e00a-370c-bb3f-b6940840963b",
                                "text": "The music press is forever weeping about corporate-dominated music, but their only real contribution is their service as Pravdas of genre orthodoxy; what's \"real jazz,\" \"real blues,\" \"real rock 'n' roll,\" blah blah blah."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5f12826-3274-4513-bba3-dbbd1efab448",
                                "sense_id": "46df4e73-e00a-370c-bb3f-b6940840963b",
                                "text": "The following is an editorial in today's New York Pravda. My comments are included."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "beb5263d-6a34-4bfa-911f-d4482a3c06ff",
                                "sense_id": "46df4e73-e00a-370c-bb3f-b6940840963b",
                                "text": "Eric Pickles, the new local government secretary, said he wanted to axe 'the weekly town hall Pravdas' to ensure that a healthy independent local press can scrutinise the work of councils."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "74d1d735-2743-4448-ab7a-aac4822a2bfd",
                                "sense_id": "46df4e73-e00a-370c-bb3f-b6940840963b",
                                "text": "Clinton did not mention Cernovich, but she attacked Alex Jones, the paranoiac Texas radio host, and Breitbart.com, the Pravda of the alt-right."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f822c7b-41b8-450d-a15c-16ad95f7f009",
                                "sense_id": "46df4e73-e00a-370c-bb3f-b6940840963b",
                                "text": "Unfund the CBC, Canada's Pravda and national enforcer of truth"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
